doctype html
html(lang='en')
    head
        include @client/components/headers_common/headers_common.pug
        include @client/components/headers_dynamic/headers_dynamic.pug

    body
        img(src='@client/imgs/features/rsz_elements_token.webp')
        h2 WARNING! IMPOSSIBLE TO PUT DOWN!
        H1 WHEN STRATEGY MEETS CHAOS
        p ADDICTIVE CARD GAME
            br
            | BEATIFUL ARTWORK
            br
            | FAST-PACED GAMEPLAY

        div
            h1 SOON ON KICKSTARTER
            p Don'tmiss limited launch day discounts!
            input(type='email', placeholder='Enter your email')
            input#checkbox(type='checkbox', name='checkbox')
            label(for='checkbox') I agree to receive the newsletter
            button(type='submit') SUBSCRIBE
            p Join 500+ members

        img(src='@client/imgs/features/rsz_elements_token.webp')

        h2 DRAW ◦ PLAY ◦ WIN
        H1 THE PERFECT COMBO: EASY AND FAST GAME + OUTSTANDING ART
        p We wanted a game that was dynamic, fun to play and had a spark of strategy, that's why we created Tricky Dragons. But we didn't stop there. We added professional artwork that makes every card a collectible.
            |
            | In the end, we had something special: A game that's easy to learn, impossible to master, and beautiful to own.
        img(src='@client/imgs/features/rsz_elements_token.webp')

        h2 MEET THE DRAGONS
        H1 EVERY CARD IS A WORK OF ART THAT BRINGS DRAGONS TO LIFE
        p Tricky Dragons features 100+ original illustrations created by professional artists who understand that great games deserve great art. Every dragon has been meticulously crafted to capture both elemental power and individual personality.
        img(src='@client/imgs/features/rsz_elements_token.webp')

        h2 THE POWER OF ELEMENTS
        H1 FINALLY, A STRATEGY GAME THAT DOESN'T LEAVE ANYONE BEHIND
        p At the heart of Tricky Dragons lies a simple elemental system new players learn in seconds, yet it transforms every card play into meaningful strategic choice. Understanding it isn't just helpful, IT'S SURVIVAL.
            |
            | Fire burns Grass
            |
            | Water extinguishes Fire
            |
            | Grass absorbs Water
        img(src='@client/imgs/features/rsz_elements_token.webp')

        div
            h1 SOON ON KICKSTARTER
            p Don'tmiss limited launch day discounts!
            input(type='email', placeholder='Enter your email')
            input#checkbox(type='checkbox', name='checkbox')
            label(for='checkbox') I agree to receive the newsletter
            button(type='submit') SUBSCRIBE
            p Join 500+ members
